  "hypothesis": "The missing code is primarily full-expression float rounding boundaries and alias-sensitive reloading, not merely the alternate channel layout. Separate float products prevent fused operations under unchanged canonical fp_contract settings; band values are reloaded after stores and products are reused only where retail reuses them. Channel-specific temporaries and delaying the next-band pointer until after integer conversion shorten live ranges.",
