    "Packed sentinel is 0x00800000, shown by subis r0,r5,0x80, not 0x80000000.",
    "Bias/layout flags are full-width u32: retail compares their saved GPR values without clrlwi.",
    "Normalize both packed integers before their float conversion.",
    "Alternate layout derives output[1], output[0], output[7], output[6] from x; derives output[5], output[4], output[3] from y; outputs[2] and [8] are zero.",
    "Old-phase alternate interpolation retains asymmetric fixed-table +0x214/+0x208 taps.",
    "Output products preserve the retail multiplication association and non-fused float operations."
